# CommonsBase_Dk

## Overview

Packages the dk0 reference build system and dk1 multithreaded build system.

`Dk0` builds MlFront's `DkZero_Exec` and its transitive dependencies from the
opam lock, one resumable build per package, and republishes `DkZero_Exec`'s
install prefix as `bin/dk0.exe`. `Dk1` is wired to build the multi-threaded
`DkOne_Exec` (dk1) the same way.

## License

Apache-2.0 AND LGPL-2.1-only WITH OCaml-LGPL-linking-exception AND OSL-3.0

